{"id":"n62510-1-16","stage":1,"title":"스트레스 · 压力","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62510-1-16-1","ko":"애들한테 너무 스트레스를 주지 말아요.","zh":"别给孩子们太大压力啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"애들한테","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애들한테","audio":"/audio/8f430abc792b24df1cc7.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"스트레스를","meaning":"压力","explanation":"스트레스：压力；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"스트레스","audio":"/audio/272ec21b191d5f48e5c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62510","senseId":"1","lemma":"스트레스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스트레스를","audio":"/audio/8e9d9ae4fec6dc093c61.mp3"}},{"text":"주지","meaning":"使感到，使受到，带来","explanation":"주다：使感到，使受到，带来；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"3","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주지","audio":"/audio/509f8c1c91f136687ac0.mp3"}},{"text":"말아요.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말아요","audio":"/audio/6f617bff27f9d046f3c5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"272ec21b191d5f48","term":"스트레스","zh":"压力","audio":"/audio/272ec21b191d5f48e5c0.mp3","entryId":"62510","definition":"在一些事情、人或环境等中心理和身体感受到压迫和紧张的状态。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"使感到，使受到，带来","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"让别人经历某事或产生某种情绪。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e21cce1e77e1824b4940.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62510-1-16-2","ko":"자기들을 위해 공부를 열심히 하라는 거잖아요.","zh":"不就是让他们为了自己好好学习吗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자기들을","meaning":"自己","explanation":"자기：自己；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자기","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57311","senseId":"1","lemma":"자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자기들을","audio":"/audio/1d4b91b0248f8d8b7c5a.mp3"}},{"text":"위해","meaning":"为了","explanation":"위하다：为了；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"위하다","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29736","senseId":"1","lemma":"위하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위해","audio":"/audio/6af4158ebe4642d40a9c.mp3"}},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부를","audio":"/audio/6cf72634fef36a3407ff.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"하라는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하라는","audio":"/audio/6d338a75722d336a7c12.mp3"}},{"text":"거잖아요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖아요：礼貌地提醒对方已知的事实：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거잖아요","audio":"/audio/7cd0918380eca9d7d181.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c11f639d43037d2","term":"자기","zh":"自己","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3","entryId":"57311","definition":"自身。","pronunciation":["자기"]},{"id":"96303fbb42bf3d76","term":"위하다","zh":"为了","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3","entryId":"29736","definition":"想要让什么有利或帮助什么。","pronunciation":["위하다"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd4b510f4b552699c478.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62510","label":"